---
import CaseStudyLayout from '../../layouts/CaseStudyLayout.astro';
---

<CaseStudyLayout
  title="Establishing Dexcom’s European Product Design Studio from Zero"
  summary="Building a globally integrated design studio while keeping delivery running at scale"
  role="Product Design Studio Manager & Senior UX Design Manager"
  timeline="2024—Present"
  platform="Web & Mobile"
>
  <!-- OVERVIEW -->
  <section class="fade-in group border-t border-white/5 pt-12" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 md:gap-24">
      <div class="md:w-48 flex-shrink-0 pt-1">
        <span class="text-xs font-medium text-[#52525B] uppercase tracking-wider">Overview</span>
      </div>
      <div class="w-full space-y-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-[#EDEDED] tracking-tight">Executive summary</h2>
        <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-[#A1A1AA] max-w-3xl">
          This case study covers my dual role as <strong class="text-[#EDEDED]">Product Design Studio Manager</strong> and
          <strong class="text-[#EDEDED]">Senior UX Design Manager</strong> at Dexcom, where I established and scaled the first Global Product Design presence in Vilnius, Lithuania.
          As the first design hire in the region, I built a multidisciplinary studio and integrated it into Dexcom’s global operating model.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-[16px] text-[#A1A1AA]">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#EDEDED] mt-2"></span><span>Hired, onboarded, and operationalized a <strong class="text-[#EDEDED]">10‑person studio</strong> within the first year</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#EDEDED] mt-2"></span><span>Reached <strong class="text-[#EDEDED]">business‑as‑usual delivery</strong> across multiple global initiatives</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#EDEDED] mt-2"></span><span>Positioned Vilnius as Dexcom’s <strong class="text-[#EDEDED]">European Product Design hub</strong></span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#EDEDED] mt-2"></span><span>Established strong collaboration with leadership across the <strong class="text-[#EDEDED]">US and EU</strong></span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#EDEDED] mt-2"></span><span>Stabilized operations, resourcing, and delivery without disrupting timelines</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SITUATION -->
  <section class="fade-in group border-t border-white/5 pt-12" style="animation-delay: 0.3s;">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 md:gap-24">
      <div class="md:w-48 flex-shrink-0 pt-1"><span class="text-xs font-medium text-[#52525B] uppercase tracking-wider">Situation</span></div>
      <div class="w-full space-y-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-[#EDEDED] tracking-tight">Context & problem</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-[16px] text-[#A1A1AA] list-disc pl-5 marker:text-[#52525B]">
          <li>No existing design studio or local leadership in Vilnius</li>
          <li>Global teams required immediate, reliable design capacity</li>
          <li>Organization operated across continents, time zones, and regulated environments</li>
          <li>Design needed tight integration with product, engineering, research, and clinical teams</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-[#A1A1AA] max-w-3xl">The challenge was to hire and stand up a studio that could operate independently while remaining fully embedded in Dexcom’s global product strategy.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TASK -->
  <section class="fade-in group border-t border-white/5 pt-12" style="animation-delay: 0.4s;">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 md:gap-24">
      <div class="md:w-48 flex-shrink-0 pt-1"><span class="text-xs font-medium text-[#52525B] uppercase tracking-wider">Task</span></div>
      <div class="w-full space-y-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-[#EDEDED] tracking-tight">Goals & responsibilities</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-[16px] text-[#A1A1AA] list-disc pl-5 marker:text-[#52525B]">
          <li>Hire and scale a multidisciplinary design and prototyping team</li>
          <li>Establish studio operations, workflows, and delivery standards</li>
          <li>Onboard the team into Dexcom’s culture, processes, and product ecosystem</li>
          <li>Ensure consistent, high‑quality delivery across global initiatives</li>
          <li>Act as a strategic partner to local and global leadership beyond design</li>
          <li>Balance people leadership with organizational and operational accountability</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-[#A1A1AA] max-w-3xl">This required building trust quickly—locally and globally—while delivering tangible results from day one.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ACTION -->
  <section class="fade-in group border-t border-white/5 pt-12" style="animation-delay: 0.5s;">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 md:gap-24">
      <div class="md:w-48 flex-shrink-0 pt-1"><span class="text-xs font-medium text-[#52525B] uppercase tracking-wider">Action</span></div>
      <div class="w-full space-y-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-[#EDEDED] tracking-tight">Process & solution</h2>
        <h3 class="text-[15px] font-medium text-[#EDEDED]">Building the Vilnius design studio</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-[16px] text-[#A1A1AA] list-disc pl-5 marker:text-[#52525B]">
          <li>Hired and scaled a <strong class="text-[#EDEDED]">10‑person</strong> team (UX, UI, design systems, illustrator, iOS/Android prototyping)</li>
          <li>Defined roles, responsibilities, collaboration models, and onboarding frameworks</li>
          <li>Established a strong culture focused on ownership, quality, and collaboration</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-[15px] font-medium text-[#EDEDED] mt-4">Global and cross‑functional integration</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-[16px] text-[#A1A1AA] list-disc pl-5 marker:text-[#52525B]">
          <li>Embedded the studio into Dexcom’s Global Product Design organization</li>
          <li>Partnered with leaders across product management, engineering, research, clinical/regulatory</li>
          <li>Aligned EU work with global vision, priorities, and standards; bridged US–EU expectations</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-[15px] font-medium text-[#EDEDED] mt-4">Operational leadership and delivery</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-[16px] text-[#A1A1AA] list-disc pl-5 marker:text-[#52525B]">
          <li>Introduced operating rhythms, planning cadences, and resourcing models</li>
          <li>Ensured stable delivery while the studio was still forming</li>
          <li>Maintained visibility into capacity, risks, and dependencies across initiatives</li>
          <li>Supported designers as both people manager and senior design leader</li>
        </ul>

        <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-[#A1A1AA] max-w-3xl">
          Alongside studio leadership, I continued to operate as a Senior UX Design Manager, contributing to design strategy,
          mentorship, and decision‑making at the global level.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- RESULT -->
  <section class="fade-in group border-t border-white/5 pt-12" style="animation-delay: 0.6s;">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 md:gap-24">
      <div class="md:w-48 flex-shrink-0 pt-1"><span class="text-xs font-medium text-[#52525B] uppercase tracking-wider">Result</span></div>
      <div class="w-full space-y-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-[#EDEDED] tracking-tight">Outcome & impact</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-[16px] text-[#A1A1AA]">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#EDEDED]"></span><span>Successfully established Dexcom’s <strong class="text-[#EDEDED]">first European Product Design studio</strong></span></li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#EDEDED]"></span><span>Reached <strong class="text-[#EDEDED]">business‑as‑usual operations</strong> within the first year</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#EDEDED]"></span><span>Enabled global teams to scale design capacity without sacrificing quality or speed</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#EDEDED]"></span><span>Built long‑term partnerships across regions and functions</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#EDEDED]"></span><span>Created a sustainable operating model for future growth in Europe</span></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-[#A1A1AA] max-w-3xl">The studio evolved from a greenfield initiative into a reliable strategic asset within Dexcom’s global product organization.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</CaseStudyLayout>

